{"id":"en-119","title":"Tool Bag Included Parts for OneLaser Machines","family":"x-series","topic":"guides","read_minutes":1,"source_url":"https://wiki.1laser.com/en/x-series/tool-bag-included-parts","source_updated_at":"2025-12-25T03:29:54.763Z","body_html":"<div><h2 id=\"tool-bag-included-parts\"> Tool Bag Included Parts</h2><div>\n\n</div><p>\nThe OneLaser tool bag includes essential accessories and maintenance tools required for machine setup, operation, and routine care. This page provides a complete overview of all included parts, their functions, and special notes to help users quickly identify and properly use each item.\n</p><div>\n\n</div><h2 id=\"machine-accessories-list\"> Machine Accessories List</h2><div>\n\n</div><figure>\n  <table>\n    <tbody>\n      <tr>\n        <td><strong>No.</strong></td>\n        <td><strong>Physical Photos</strong></td>\n        <td><strong>Item Name</strong></td>\n        <td><strong>Application / Description</strong></td>\n        <td><strong>Notes</strong></td>\n      </tr>\n\n      <tr>\n        <td>1</td>\n        <td>\n          <figure>\n            <img src=\"https://wiki.1laser.com/x-series/tool-bag/1_tool-bag_internet_cable.jpg\" alt=\"Ethernet internet cable included in OneLaser tool bag\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\">\n          </figure>\n        </td>\n        <td>Internet Cable</td>\n        <td>Connecting the software and machine</td>\n        <td>—</td>\n      </tr>\n\n      <tr>\n        <td>2</td>\n        <td>\n          <figure>\n            <img src=\"https://wiki.1laser.com/x-series/tool-bag/2_tool-bag_pc_cable.jpg\" alt=\"PC connection cable for OneLaser machine\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\">\n          </figure>\n        </td>\n        <td>PC Cable</td>\n        <td>Connecting the software and machine</td>\n        <td>—</td>\n      </tr>\n\n      <tr>\n        <td>3</td>\n        <td>\n          <figure>\n            <img src=\"https://wiki.1laser.com/x-series/tool-bag/3_tool-bag_usb_cable.jpg\" alt=\"USB cable for connecting laser camera\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\">\n          </figure>\n        </td>\n        <td>USB Cable</td>\n        <td>Connecting the camera</td>\n        <td>—</td>\n      </tr>\n\n      <tr>\n        <td>4</td>\n        <td>\n          <figure>\n            <img src=\"https://wiki.1laser.com/x-series/tool-bag/4_tool_bag_main_power_cord.jpg\" alt=\"Main power cord for OneLaser machine\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\">\n          </figure>\n        </td>\n        <td>Main Power Cord</td>\n        <td>Power the machine</td>\n        <td>—</td>\n      </tr>\n\n      <tr>\n        <td>5</td>\n        <td>\n          <figure>\n            <img src=\"https://wiki.1laser.com/x-series/tool-bag/5_tool_bag_allen_wrench_set.jpg\" alt=\"Allen wrench set for laser maintenance\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\">\n          </figure>\n        </td>\n        <td>Allen Wrench Set</td>\n        <td>Maintenance tool</td>\n        <td>—</td>\n      </tr>\n\n      <tr>\n        <td>6</td>\n        <td>\n          <figure>\n            <img src=\"https://wiki.1laser.com/x-series/tool-bag/6_tool_bag_q-tips.jpg\" alt=\"Cotton swabs for cleaning laser lens\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\">\n          </figure>\n        </td>\n        <td>Q-tips</td>\n        <td>Clean lens</td>\n        <td>—</td>\n      </tr>\n\n      <tr>\n        <td>7</td>\n        <td>\n          <figure>\n            <img src=\"https://wiki.1laser.com/x-series/tool-bag/7_tool_bag_funnel.jpg\" alt=\"Plastic funnel for filling coolant in XT model\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\">\n          </figure>\n        </td>\n        <td>Funnel</td>\n        <td>Used for filling coolant or liquids</td>\n        <td>Only for XT</td>\n      </tr>\n\n      <tr>\n        <td>8</td>\n        <td>\n          <figure>\n            <img src=\"https://wiki.1laser.com/x-series/tool-bag/8_tool_bag_lens_cleaner.jpg\" alt=\"Laser lens cleaning solution bottle\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\">\n          </figure>\n        </td>\n        <td>Lens Cleaner</td>\n        <td>Clean lens</td>\n        <td>—</td>\n      </tr>\n\n      <tr>\n        <td>9</td>\n        <td>\n          <figure>\n            </figure></td></tr></tbody></table></figure></div>","headings":[{"level":1,"id":"tool-bag-included-parts","text":"Tool Bag Included Parts"},{"level":2,"id":"machine-accessories-list","text":"Machine Accessories List"}],"technical_version":"unknown"}